OL,3,CGirl, six, dies after suffering head
OL,4,Cinjuries in tractor collision
OL,6,FA six-year-old girl has died after
OL,7,Fsuffering serious injuries in a crash
OL,8,Finvolving a car and a tractor in
OL,9,FWarwickshire.
OL,11,FWarwickshire Police were called to
OL,12,Freports of a collision involving a
OL,13,Ftractor and a Volkswagen Tiguan on
OL,14,FFriday (31 July) on Fosse Way near
OL,15,FMoreton Morrell.
OL,17,FThe incident happened on the stretch
OL,18,Fof road between the turning for
OL,19,FCompton Verney and the Five Ways
OL,20,Froundabout, near the B4100 Banbury
OL,21,FRoad.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
