OL,3,CGirl, six, dies after suffering head
OL,4,Cinjuries in tractor collision
OL,6,FParamedics found a six-year-old girl
OL,7,Fwith serious head injuries. She died
OL,8,Fin hospital on Saturday morning (1
OL,9,FAugust).
OL,11,FThe drivers of the tractor and the
OL,12,FVolkswagen Tiguan and two young
OL,13,Fpassengers in the car were not injured.
OL,15,FWarwickshire Police says the girl's
OL,16,Ffamily is being supported by specially
OL,17,Ftrained officers.
